CLASS:: MP1Serial
SUMMARY:: Play the original Layer I subband instrument
CATEGORIES:: UGens>MPEG Audio
RELATED:: Guides/MPEGAudio, Classes/MP1Decode, Classes/MP1Clock

DESCRIPTION::
This instrument uses a 32-sample scan and 12 scans per frame at the server sample rate.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: ar
Drive the Layer I synthesis bank directly.

ARGUMENT:: word
The word for this host sample’s scan position.

ARGUMENT:: address
A negative address follows the scan. In parallel mode a scalar rotates the bank and an array maps lanes to destination bands.

ARGUMENT:: allocation
Layer I allocation indices 0–14. Zero silences a subband.

ARGUMENT:: scale
Layer I scalefactor indices 0–62. Increasing the index by 3 halves amplitude.

ARGUMENT:: raw
Use 0 for bipolar normalized words or 1 for unsigned quantizer codes in the legacy instrument.

RETURNS:: An array of PCM, scan position and frame-start pulse.
